  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Whoopie pies are soft chocolate rounds sandwiched with a cream-cheese filling. The batter is similar to a moist chocolate sponge; the key difference from a standard cake is that the mixture is thick enough to hold a domed shape when spooned onto a tray. Pipe or spoon the filling generously: the ratio of cake to cream cheese should feel almost equal."
          }
        ]
      },
